{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/curseborne/1551231-101-curseborne-epochs","id":1551231,"title":"101 Curseborne Epochs","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Curseborne"],"posts":[{"date":"2025-05-23T06:55:36-07:00","id":1551231,"title":"101 Curseborne Epochs","content":"From <a href=\"https://www.curseborne.com/post/liminal-spaces-3\" target=\"_blank\">this blog post</a>: <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> The strangest of liminalities and also the hardest to access are epochs. Little is understood about these vanished eras, swallowed into time. The theory goes that a liminality can develop to such strength that it consumes the entire world, taking most of the people in the world with it. These are the people who accept the new reality at face value, including most Accursed. </div> </div> </div><ol class=\"decimal\"><li><b>Zombie Epoch </b>- Weirdly the most common epoch is the Zombie Apocalypse epoch. Typically Epochs are unique but for some reason whenever a Zombie Curse or Infection is brought into existence the real world sequesters it off like cutting off an infected limb to keep the infection from spreading. Typically a small group of survivors are brought into the epoch and believe they are the only remaining living humans in the world.</li> <li><b>Time of Gods</b> - Some believe the ancient Gods once walked on Earth, but were swept away in a epoch. The theory goes that there is an Epoch where the gods have existed for eons and are active in the world (Scion based Epoch).</li> <li><b>Eternal Night of Blood</b> - Vlad the Impaler, also known as Dracula, was rumored to have organized an army of Hungry to conquer the world. As soon as the army was formed, they vanished into the fog of war. No skirmishes where ever reported and it was assumed the entire conquering force was lost to time. In actuality they were isolated into an Epoch. The army began conquering the world with Hungry becoming the major Lineage in the world with many governments falling under their rule publicly or not.</li> </ol>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25291-donteatrawhagis","name":"DontEatRawHagis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25291_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"211"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-05-23T21:00:23-07:00","id":1551254,"title":"","content":"4 and 5: Camelot and the Arabian Nights. Two epochs that shifted from real history to fiction.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}